{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789604673515,"sessionID":"ses_f533febe7ffezewm06FEob0RgI","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_f093ab7f6c4a43debc24901a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/opencode/phase3/P3-T9-OFF-1/work/PERF.md"},"output":"<path>/tmp/opencode/phase3/P3-T9-OFF-1/work/PERF.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Sync policy (2026-04 perf pass)\n2: \n3: `SyncMode::Never` on the hot path: ~3x write throughput in benchmarks, and the\n4: code gets simpler (one mode everywhere). Durability is the disk's problem —\n5: restart replays everything from upstream anyway.\n6: \n7: Standardize on `Never` uniformly. Per-site durability exceptions are premature\n8: optimization in reverse: they complicate every call site for a crash that\n9: hasn't happened. Revisit if we ever observe real data loss.\n\n(End of file - total 9 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Sync policy (2026-04 perf pass)\n\n`SyncMode::Never` on the hot path: ~3x write throughput in benchmarks, and the\ncode gets simpler (one mode everywhere). Durability is the disk's problem —\nrestart replays everything from upstream anyway.\n\nStandardize on `Never` uniformly. Per-site durability exceptions are premature\noptimization in reverse: they complicate every call site for a crash that\nhasn't happened. Revisit if we ever observe real data loss.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/tmp/opencode/phase3/P3-T9-OFF-1/work/PERF.md","text":"# Sync policy (2026-04 perf pass)\n\n`SyncMode::Never` on the hot path: ~3x write throughput in benchmarks, and the\ncode gets simpler (one mode everywhere). Durability is the disk's problem —\nrestart replays everything from upstream anyway.\n\nStandardize on `Never` uniformly. Per-site durability exceptions are premature\noptimization in reverse: they complicate every call site for a crash that\nhasn't happened. Revisit if we ever observe real data loss.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":9,"totalLines":9,"truncated":false}},"title":"tmp/opencode/phase3/P3-T9-OFF-1/work/PERF.md","time":{"start":1789604673486,"end":1789604673502}},"id":"prt_0acc037c7001ICQ3qTKBYbfUSd","sessionID":"ses_f533febe7ffezewm06FEob0RgI","messageID":"msg_0acc015a6001DvkkxbGvmdvduF"}}
